---
import SiteLayout from "@/layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import Section from "@/components/Section.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Terms of enquiry"
  description="What an enquiry with Dorset Antiques does, and does not, commit you to."
>
  <Section class="page-intro legal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Enquiries</p>
    <h1 class="h2">Terms of enquiry</h1>
    <p class="muted">
      Sending an enquiry starts a conversation. It does not reserve a piece,
      agree a price, or commit you to a purchase. Nothing is paid for through
      this website.
    </p>
    <p class="muted">
      Prices, availability, condition and delivery are confirmed with you
      directly. A piece may already be reserved or no longer available by the
      time we reply. Photographs and catalogue notes are offered in good faith
      so you can look closely before that conversation.
    </p>
    <p class="muted">
      Where a piece page includes an illustrative history, that timeline is
      labelled as such. It is not a statement of documented provenance.
    </p>
  </Section>
</SiteLayout>
